@Degree.SphereCube.factor_cubeHomologyClass_cycle : ∀ {m : ℕ} {X : Type} [inst : TopologicalSpace X] {x : X}
  (p : ↑(GenLoop (Fin (m + 2)) X x)),
  (SingularMayerVietoris.singularHomologyMap (Degree.SphereCube.factorMap ⋯ p) (m + 2))
